## Error Handling

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD - Tratar erros de forma consistente
const { data, error, isLoading } = useTransactions(params);

if (error) {
  if (error instanceof NetworkError) {
    return <NetworkErrorView />;
  }
  if (error.status === 404) {
    return <NotFound />;
  }
  return <ErrorView message={error.message} />;
}
```

